# P31: move focus with Tab and operate whatever it lands on.
#
# This is the file the keyboard half of the synthesiser exists for. Every other
# file here clicks; P31 asks whether focus moves at all, and a click that lands
# on a control sidesteps the question by putting focus there directly. So the
# first click is the only one, into the field, and everything after it is Tab.
#
# Shift-Tab is included because focus that moves forward but not back is a
# different bug from focus that does not move, and the two look identical in a
# file that only goes one way.
#
# Ctrl-Q is not sent, though P31's own instructions ask for it. It quits the app,
# and a replay that quits halfway leaves its remaining rows unrun with nothing to
# show. Same decision as P10, same reason.
#
# The alert is opened last. Escape is what P31 wants tested against it, and if
# Escape does not dismiss it the app is left modal -- so nothing this file still
# needs comes after that row.
#
# P31：以 Tab 移動焦點，並操作它所落到的任何東西。
#
# 這正是 synthesiser 的鍵盤部分存在的理由。此處其他每一份檔案都在點擊；P31 問的是「焦點究竟會不會
# 移動」，而落在控制項上的點擊會把焦點直接放上去，因此迴避了這個問題。所以第一次點擊是唯一的一次，
# 點進欄位裡，其後的一切都是 Tab。
#
# 納入 Shift-Tab，是因為「能往前移動但不能往回」的焦點，與「根本不移動」的焦點是不同的缺陷，
# 而在一份只往單一方向走的檔案裡，兩者看起來完全一樣。
#
# 不送出 Ctrl-Q，儘管 P31 自己的說明要求它。它會結束 app，而中途結束的重放會使其餘各列未執行且
# 無可呈現。與 P10 相同的決定，相同的理由。
#
# alert 排在最後開啟。Escape 正是 P31 想針對它測試的東西，而若 Escape 無法關閉它，app 就會停留在
# modal 狀態——因此本檔仍需要的一切，都不排在那一列之後。
#
# origin=frame. Window 780x588 points, capture 1560px wide -- scale 2.
# origin=frame。視窗 780x588 點，擷取寬 1560px——scale 2。
click,390,307,frame,left,,,into the text field -- the only click in this file,macos
sleep,,,,,,600000,,macos
key,,,,,t,,,macos
key,,,,,a,,,macos
key,,,,,b,,"type something -- the field must keep reading tab at the end",macos
sleep,,,,,,600000,,macos
# **The Tab / Space / arrow rows are removed (2026-09-28).** Whether Tab stops on a
# button is macOS's Keyboard navigation setting (AppleKeyboardUIMode), not the app's
# or the backend's: it is off by default and off on this machine, so Tab stayed in
# the only text field and Space and the arrows edited its text. Every macOS capture
# back to 2026-09-01 showed Button 0 uncounted and the field emptied by those keys.
# With the setting on they are meaningful and belong in a file of their own.
# **Tab / Space / 方向鍵那幾列已移除(2026-09-28)。**Tab 會不會停在按鈕上,是 macOS 的「鍵盤導覽」設定
# (AppleKeyboardUIMode)決定的,不是 app 也不是 backend:它預設關閉,這台機器上也是關的,所以 Tab 一直留在唯一的
# 文字欄位裡,Space 與方向鍵則改了欄位的文字。回溯到 2026-09-01 的每一張 macOS 擷圖都顯示 Button 0 沒被計數、欄位
# 被那些鍵清空。設定開啟時它們才有意義,應該放在自己的檔案裡。
click,107,372,frame,left,,,Open alert for Escape test -- the log writes alert opened,macos
sleep,,,,,,2000000,,macos
key,,,,,escape,,"the row P31 is really asking about: the alert must close. AppKitBackend makes Escape answer a one-button alert from 2026-09-28 -- NSAlert binds Escape only to a button titled Cancel, and until then the alert was still up in every capture. The capture must show no alert and the field reading tab; debug-events/p31-debug-events.log must hold alert opened",macos
sleep,,,,,,2000000,,macos
